  message: "P0/P1 SWEEP 2026-08-17, dev 11a240f83d. Every claim below was re-derived against the current tree, not re-read off this thread.\n\nCARRIER RE-CHECKED, WORKING, NOT DISCHARGED. Verified mechanically at dev 11a240f83d rather than assumed: this item is todo_hard (a blocking status) with isbefore=[INV-zogud], INV-zogud is violated/P3, and INV-zogud does NOT appear in tracker ready (223 items). The post-condition the item filed as its positive control still holds.\n\nA NEAR-MISS WORTH RECORDING, since this item exists because a deferral expired silently once. A grep for 'INV-zogud' in the ready output returns a hit, and I nearly read that as the carrier having failed. The hit is inside THIS item's own title, which names its target. The carrier's own row in ready is what makes its target look present.\n\nAlso unchanged: the mypy strict baseline is 672 (.ci/mypy-strict-baseline.json, mypy 2.1.0), matching the figure the campaign is held at. Nothing about the hold has moved, and per this item's own rule, inactivity is not discharge. What is still missing is the ratified exit condition -- 'straightened out' remains undefined, and that is the first thing to ask the owner."  # 7119
