  message: "PRIORITY CHANGED 2026-08-17, on owner authorisation, as part of the P0/P1 sweep. Recording the reasoning here because a re-rank that lives only in conversation is indistinguishable next session from drift.\n\nP1 -> P4. This item's title begins \"CARRIER (do not work directly)\" and it was sitting at RANK 7 of 227 in tracker ready. A carrier blocks its target through its STATUS (todo_hard is a blocking status), not through its priority, so its rank buys nothing and costs a top-10 slot advertising an item nobody may work.\n\nTHE CARRIER IS UNAFFECTED AND STILL WORKING -- verified 2026-08-17: todo_hard, isbefore=[INV-zogud], and INV-zogud absent from ready. Per this item's own rule, inactivity is not discharge and this re-rank is not discharge either. The unratified exit condition (\"straightened out\" is still undefined) remains the open question."  # bc77
