  message: "CAMPAIGN PLAN RECORDED 2026-08-24, owner-directed (\"devise a plan to extinguish\nall of these issues at their roots\"). This carrier is the natural home for the\npointer, since the plan IS the proposed path to the end of the deferral this\nitem holds.\n\nFull plan: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/taint_root_extinguish_plan_08242026.md\nCompressed operating frame: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/LIVE.md section 4.\n\nSHAPE: the 67 open items across taint/dataflow/ddg/io_boundary/verify_claims/\nadr_0017 (27 violated, 28 todo_hard, 5 P1) are ~SIX ROOT FAMILIES, each with a\nchokepoint fix -- or a dated declared blindness where capacity is deferred.\n\nORDER, with the rationale that fixes the order: P0 verify premises (statuses\nare demonstrably stale: INV-pirot filed 08-06 is likely closed by WI-sajis done\n08-24) -> P1 fail-open family (\"never looked\" must read UNKNOWN -- a lying\ninstrument corrupts every later measurement, so this precedes measuring) -> P2\nlabel vocabulary (INV-tutar: env_read->host_secret, 48/85 flows @22.9%, the\nlargest single quantified precision loss) -> P3 measurement 0005 re-baseline ->\nOWNER RE-RANKS -> P4 refutation capacity -> P5 gate correctness + the WI-lutuh\nstdlib campaign (rust 33 -> js 13 -> python 53) -> P6 recall class INV-linub,\nGATED on the P3 number per the standing band ruling -> P7 identity/label\nstragglers.\n\nEXIT: every family closed-with-evidence or declared-blind + 0005 published ->\nPROPOSE releasing this carrier so INV-zogud re-enters ready. The exit itself is\nthe owner's declaration (ruling on record: human vibes, no criteria) -- the\nchecklist is input, never self-certification.\n\nOWNER DECISION POINTS, explicit so none is decided alone: (1) P2 boundary/label\nsplit ratification; (2) P3->P6 re-rank; (3) P5 instrument decision for\njava/swift/objc/scala completeness; (4) exit.\n\nThis item stays todo_hard and keeps blocking INV-zogud throughout -- that is\nits job; nothing here works the carrier directly."  # cf01
